# An order service calls a payment gateway. The first call times out and the second returns 503; it
# waits longer before each retry, the third attempt is approved and the payment is recorded in the
# ledger.
title Payment retry
order[Order Service] -> pg[Payment Gateway] : authorize
pg -x order : timeout
wait 1
order -> pg : authorize (retry 1)
pg -x order : 503
wait 2
order -> pg : authorize (retry 2)
pg --> order : approved
order -> ledger[Ledger] : record payment
